    "combined-split-main": "#Traverse Only\n# 2025 Suvery Design Pre-Analysis\n\n########################\n#\tPoint\tEasting(m)\tNorthing(m)\theight (m)\n##### GPS Points \n\nB GPS5-GPS2 323-9-42.23 6.74\nC FRDN            7437047.54400 2487601.21100  117.93000 ! ! !\n\nC OOP      \t\t  7438438.73337 2488810.23706   64.87179\nC GPS2            7438481.05527 2489236.28805   37.70454\nC BROD            7438971.17072 2489016.30295   16.81050 \nC APOG            7438154.06015 2488813.58638   82.63196 \nC GPS5            7438251.14192 2489408.52280   44.69352  \nC GPS6            7438735.41455 2488974.81206   34.30933 \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n#---------------------------------100------------------------------------#\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n.INST\tSX12\t#SET 1\t \t \nDB\t100\t \t \t \nDM\tAPOG\t0-0-0\t106.8333\t86-41-24.98\nDM\tPEAT\t301-35-57.6\t30.1874\t92-29-12.58  & & 50\nDM\t124\t182-29-58.6\t81.6249\t95-21-16.88\nDM\t126\t69-13-27.55\t76.825\t88-5-31.8\nDE\t \t \t \t \n \t\t \t \t \n.INST\tSX12\t#SET 2\t \t \nDB\t100\t \t \t \nDM\tAPOG\t0-0-0\t106.8334\t86-41-23.73\nDM\tPEAT\t301-36-1.1\t30.1873\t92-29-12.69  & & 50\nDM\t124\t182-30-1.8\t81.6249\t95-21-16.48\nDM\t126\t69-13-25.4\t76.8252\t88-5-30.9\nDE\t \t \t \t \n  \t \t \n.INST\tSX12\t#SET 3\t \t \nDB\t100\t \t \t \nDM\tAPOG\t0-0-0\t106.8332\t86-41-24.23\nDM\tPEAT\t301-35-58.45\t30.1871\t92-29-12.6  & & 50\nDM\t124\t182-29-56.7\t81.6248\t95-21-17.23\nDM\t126\t69-13-24.05\t76.8254\t88-5-31.9\nDE\t \t \t \t \n\t \t \t \n.INST\tSX12\t#SET 4\t \t \nDB\t100\t \t \t \nDM\tAPOG\t0-0-0\t106.8328\t86-41-23.13\nDM\tPEAT\t301-35-57.25\t30.1876\t92-29-11.67  & & 50\nDM\t124\t182-29-53\t81.6253\t95-21-18.93\nDM\t126\t69-13-20.85\t76.8258\t88-5-32.65\nDE\t \t \t \t \n\t\t\t\t\n#---------------------------------101------------------------------------#\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n.INST\tSX12\t#SET 1\t \t \nDB\t101\t \t \t \nDM\tPEAT\t0-0-0\t27.953\t95-59-38.21\nDM\t102\t137-48-19.6\t33.4407\t88-2-7.22   & & 50\nDE\t \t 